==English==

===Etymology===
Past participle of {{m|en|serrate}}, From {{etyl|la|en}} {{attention|la}} {{m|la|serratus||saw shaped}}, from {{m|la|serra||saw}}.

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

# [[saw]]-liko.
#: ''That knife has a '''serrated''' blade.''
# Having a row of [[sharp]] or [[tooth]]-like [[projection]]s.
#: ''Maple leaves have '''serrated''' edges.''

